  "delta": [
    "D7 freezes the six context-lint rules, the exact warn/error thresholds and the per-rule location keys. The upstream context-lint.json stays byte-identical; these cases live in the phone overlay.",
    "Each valid case supplies only inputs; expected findings are frozen here so Swift BotContextLint and the Python reference validator consume the same values. Evidence strings are diagnostics, never a wire contract.",
    "Invalid findings prove the closed rule/severity/location shape. Threshold type errors are rejected by the reader; non-positive thresholds are coerced exactly as observability.md §4 states."
  ],
